--TEST--
A bare literal at a call site says nothing about which parameter it filled, so it is the one argument that gets the name — read off the slots the checker recorded for that call, `rule:ide/completion-offers-only-what-the-compiler-derived`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Greeter {
    public function greet(string $name, string $tone): string { return $name; }
}
var $g = new Greeter();
$g->greet("world", "warm");
--REQUEST--
inlayHint
--EXPECT--
5:7 type : Greeter
6:11 parameter name:
6:20 parameter tone:
